Package: ggplasmid
Title: Plasmid-First Linear and Circular Maps with ggplot2
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhong", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "yzhong005@e.ntu.edu.sg")
  )
Author: Zhong Yang
Maintainer: Zhong Yang <yzhong005@e.ntu.edu.sg>
Description: Draw plasmid-first linear and circular feature maps with ggplot2.
    The package accepts annotation tables or GenBank files, can compute GC skew
    from FASTA/GenBank sequence, and provides a small phage wrapper for phage
    category colors and optional linear-terminal marking on circular layouts.
